 \text { earthworms }\end{array} & Region & \begin{array}{c}\text { Number of } 
 \text { earthworms }\end{array} 
\hlineA & 107 & \mathrm{~F} & 141 
\hlineB & 147 & \mathrm{G} & 150 
\hlineC & 146 & \mathrm{H} & 154 
\hlineD & 135 & \mathrm{I} & 176 
\hlineE & 149 & \mathrm{~J} & 166 
\hline\end{tabular}\end{center}Which of the following is a reasonable approximation of the number of earthworms to a depth of 5 centimeters beneath the ground's surface in the entire field?

